<title>USA: Wackenhut gets $67.5 mln prison contract.</title>
<headline>Wackenhut gets $67.5 mln prison contract.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Fla. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wackenhut Corrections Corp said Wednesday that it has signed a five-year $67.5 million renewal agreement with the Queensland Corrective Services Commission in Brisbane, Australia, to manage the 578-bed Arthur Gorrie Correctional Center. It has managed the facility since April, 1992.</p>
<p>The company has 37 correctional/detention facilities under contract/award in North America, Europe and Australia, with a total of over 27,000 beds.</p>
